  "description": {
   "en": "University student Mimi Usazaki spends her days battling depression while attending psychiatric sessions and muddling through a bleak college life. One fateful day, she's caught up in a mysterious experiment that alters her life forever. Through the experiment, she ends up hosting the consciousness of Hyou Usazaki—her estranged younger brother, who also happens to be a death row inmate. Now, Mimi finds herself thrust into a deadly struggle against other death row inmates who were subjected to the same experiment. Will she survive the chaos that ensues? Or will her connection to her brother bring about her downfall?",
   "ja": "現代日本・犯罪多発都市『アナキ市』そこで善良な一般市民の脳に凶悪死刑囚の意識を植え込む実験が、秘密裏に開始される。気弱な女子大生・ミミはある日、実験の被検体に選ばれ死刑囚であり、生き別れの弟でもあるヒョウと肉体を共有することになり…！？"
  },
